NNOOTTEESS
       For partitions, some information (e.g., queue attributes) is inherited
       from the parent device.

       The llssbbllkk command needs to be able to look up each block device by
       major:minor numbers, which is done by using _/_s_y_s_/_d_e_v_/_b_l_o_c_k. This sysfs
       block directory appeared in kernel 2.6.27 (October 2008). In case of
       problems with a new enough kernel, check that CCOONNFFIIGG__SSYYSSFFSS was enabled
       at the time of the kernel build.

